core|the file manager, screenshots, mc, htop|pcmanfm scrot mc htop|pcmanfm scrot mc htop|pcmanfm scrot mc htop|pcmanfm scrot mc htop
build|compilers and X headers (to build c64desk, st, dmenu, the bar)|build-essential pkg-config patch ncurses-bin libx11-dev libxft-dev libxext-dev libxfixes-dev libxrandr-dev libxinerama-dev libxcb1-dev libxcb-xinerama0-dev libxcb-randr0-dev libx11-xcb-dev libfreetype-dev libfontconfig-dev|base-devel patch ncurses|gcc make pkgconf-pkg-config patch ncurses libX11-devel libXft-devel libXext-devel libXfixes-devel libXrandr-devel libXinerama-devel libxcb-devel xcb-util-devel freetype-devel fontconfig-devel|build-base pkgconf patch ncurses libx11-dev libxft-dev libxext-dev libxfixes-dev libxrandr-dev libxinerama-dev libxcb-dev xcb-util-dev freetype-dev fontconfig-dev
crt|picom (the CRT filter over every window)|picom|picom|picom|picom
sound|PipeWire (only when no sound server is installed)|pipewire pipewire-pulse wireplumber pipewire-alsa pulseaudio-utils|pipewire pipewire-pulse wireplumber pipewire-alsa libpulse|pipewire pipewire-pulseaudio wireplumber pipewire-alsa pulseaudio-utils|pipewire pipewire-pulse wireplumber pipewire-alsa pulseaudio-utils
vice|VICE, the C64 emulator (BASIC on the desktop, C64 software)|src:vice|vice|vice/src:vice|vice@testing
